      en: "Quarry Bay is a major business and residential district in the east of Hong Kong Island, known for its striking industrial-residential architecture.",
      es: "Quarry Bay es un importante distrito comercial y residencial en el este de la isla de Hong Kong, conocido por su distintiva arquitectura industrial.",
