      en: ["Home to the Cattle Depot Artist Village.", "Known for the historic Sung Wong Toi Garden.", "Features many classic 'Tong Lau' tenement blocks.", "The name literally translates to 'Potato Bay'."],
      es: ["Sede del Cattle Depot Artist Village.", "Conocido por el jardín Sung Wong Toi.", "Posee muchos edificios históricos 'Tong Lau'.", "Su nombre significa \"Bahía de la Patata\"."],
